&lt;br /&gt;
The widget color is not used.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
== See Also ==&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
* [[Widgets]]&lt;br /&gt;
* &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;[http://c4engine.com/docs/InterfaceMgr/OrthoViewportWidget.html OrthoViewportWidget]&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; class&lt;br /&gt;
